# Sourced by scripts/create-environment.sh --scenario wiki_sites
#
# catalog and keycloak are always deployed by the script — this file only lists
# the optional pieces from e2e/components/ this scenario needs.
#
# COMPONENTS: standalone components to apply, space-separated, in this order.
# wiki-sites renders the wikis and the wiki gateway from the naira chart (values
# in components/wiki-sites-values.yaml) and builds the starter from wiki/starter.
# It comes before portal: the portal reads the wikis ConfigMap once, when it starts.
COMPONENTS="wiki-sites portal"

# PLUGINS: none. The scenario does not look at the catalog.
PLUGINS=""
